window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Sophia thought her world would slowly ebb away in the drunken squaller of a bar after an IED ended her exceptional military career in a hail of shrapnel and pain. She was firmly intrenched in her mundane life; serving drinks and breaking balls in a New York bar until a breathtakingly sexy and mysterious man saunters in and flips her life upside down and sets her temper blazing. Everything she thought she knew about herself was a lie. To make things worse, she learns that she is the heir of some prophecy told through out mythological realms for centuries. She must choose a union between the Vampire race or the Elf race, whose numbers are dwindling. Does she choose Fire or Ice and is she strong enough sway the fight against the annihilation of the human race?</p>"; 
